 "beyond_the_form": {
  "(templates)": [
   "use: template instantiation by textual substitution (STAGE, CONV, FACTOR, CLASS). Not a computation, but the specification is written with it; step counts are given after expansion."
  ],
  "(shared)": [
   "stage gate 'stages == [stage]' is evaluated as (length == 1) and (one entry equal to the stage): a scatter-add over the child table factors.stages"
  ],
  "(every unit with a factor look-up)": [
   "match: record by factor id (dictionary key, unique: no order needed)",
   "match: first row-specific conversion (order = position in the row's list) and first scenario conversion (order = row order of the table); priority identity > row-specific > scenario table is written as three mutually exclusive predicate products (negation flag)"
  ],
  "A13-05": [
   "division Q/(1-w) is the product Q * (1/(1-w)): can differ from the reference in the last bit"
  ],
  "X-13": [
   "difference ordered - installed needs the constant factor -1"
  ],
  "A13-02": [
   "'|sum - 1| <= 1e-6' needs the constant -1 (residual) and a range predicate",
   "the reference stops at the first unusable component; the specification counts unusable components (same public result because the partial sum is discarded)"
  ],
  "X-15": [
   "list equality (declared stages == stages of the record) needs a positional join: gather the record row into the child table, match on (record row, position), count equal entries (3 steps)",
   "validity date >= assessment date: text order of ISO dates (pre-processing: rank of interned strings)",
   "priority declaration > composite > generic: mutually exclusive indicator columns (negation), not min",
   "enumeration 'kind' is read from three indicator columns (post-processing)"
  ],
  "X-03": [
   "dictionary outputs keyed by factor id: scatter-add into the factor table plus a count column that selects the keys (post-processing read-out)"
  ],
  "A5-01": [
   "NOT EXPRESSED EXACTLY: the reference splits the grid unit text at '/' (text operation). The specification uses a closed list of three texts (kgCO2e/kWh, kgCO2e/MWh, kgCO2e/MJ); a scenario that registers a conversion from kWh to another unit is outside the list",
   "match with constant keys (kWh -> MWh, kWh -> MJ)"
  ],
  "A5-04": [
   "output 'other_assessed' is a literal constant; 'parts' is a read-out of results of other units"
  ],
  "X-17": [
   "six summary classes are six instantiations of one template (4 steps each); the classes and their summary columns are listed in the specification because a column cannot be addressed by a value",
   "division sum/quantity is the product sum * (1/quantity)"
  ],
  "X-16": [
   "match: price index by year (dictionary key, unique)",
   "ratio of two indices is index * (1/index)"
  ],
  "X-12": [
   "division by the load factor is a product with 1/x"
  ],
  "(all units)": [
   "integer-typed inputs passed through by the reference keep type int; the engine returns float (type only)",
   "strings are interned to integer codes before evaluation (pre-processing, generic)"
  ]
 },
